OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRather cloudy at times with the
OL,6,Fchance of a few light passing showers.
OL,7,FThis afternoon will be dry with some
OL,8,Fbright or sunny spells. Brisk
OL,9,Fnorthwesterly winds easing down.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThis evening will be mainly
OL,12,Fdry. The rest of the night will be
OL,13,Fmainly dry although some patchy rain
OL,14,Fwill spread east for a time.
OL,15,FFreshening southwesterly wind.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
