OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FMainly dry and cloudy with a
OL,6,Flittle patchy rain at times, this
OL,7,Fmainly across the west. Best of any
OL,8,Fbrightness across eastern
OL,9,FAberdeenshire. Brisk southwesterly
OL,10,Fwinds.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMainly
OL,13,Fdry on Saturday although some
OL,14,Foccasional rain possible across the
OL,15,Fwest at times. Patchy rain at first on
OL,16,FSunday, otherwise dry. Dry on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
